Establish `hfin : Finite (HkKer P.asIdeal (charAt P) k z.1)` using `GlobalTheory.HeckePointLaw.heckePointLaws.1 _ _ _ _ (T0.Q.Xo ((j : ℕ) + 1)) T0.Q.c P.asIdeal (charAt P) k hHP _ z.1`. Take `⟨y, rfl⟩` from `(YS.eF i _ b (Nat.le_add_left _ _) j.2).symm.surjective f`. Rewrite using `[LinearEquiv.apply_symm_apply]`. Establish `key : ∀ y : NX.KB S i b ⊗[S.Ks] NX.FmK S ((j : ℕ) + 1), valAt YS fw j z.1 (YS.eF i _ b (Nat.le_add_left _ _) j.2 (D.nexp.hkF i _ b k P ((YS.eF i _ b (Nat.le_add_left _ _) j.2).symm y))) = (iC c)⁻¹ * embC YS iC b s * ∑ᶠ C, valAt YS fw j (quot C) y`. Introduce `y`.

